---
import Layout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Section from '../../components/ui/Section.astro';
import '../../styles/global.css';
import HeroBanner from "../../components/ui/HeroBanner.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../../components/ui/Eyebrow.astro";
import Heading from "../../components/ui/Heading.astro";
import BookDemo from "../../components/ui/BookDemo.astro";
import Blockquote from "../../components/ui/Blockquote.astro";
import FlippingCard from "../../components/ui/FlippingCard.astro";
---

<Layout>
   <div
    class="max-w-[110rem] mx-auto text-center text-shadow-md text-shadow-neutral-950"
  >
    <HeroBanner
      height="sm"
      image="../../assets/images/asset-criticality-banner-01.jpg"
    >
      <h1 class="text-6xl font-medium leading-tight text-white lg:text-6xl">
       Precision EAM Assessments


        <!-- <span class="block text-white"> Reliability Improvement </span> -->
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-3xl leading-8 text-slate-100">
        Identify and close the gaps in your Reliability & Asset Management Program!


      </p>
    </HeroBanner>
  </div>
  <Section>
    

  <div
    class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8  pt-8  md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14 "
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 divide-y divide-accent/80">
      <div class="pb-6 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <Eyebrow class="text-black">
          ASSESS - ANALYZE - BENCHMARK - STRATEGY DEVELOPMENT

        </Eyebrow>

        <Heading class="mb-4 " level={3}>
          <span class="">Fully Automated Assessments</span>
        </Heading>
        <p>
          We used to perform assessments the traditional way and found major problems. They took a <strong>week of time</strong>, averaged around <strong>$30,000</strong>, asked around <strong>600-700 questions</strong> and, in the end, <strong>nobody used the findings</strong>
          
        </p>

          <p>
         This lead to a major breakthrough! We developed the <span
            class="text-orange-400 font-bold">Precision Assessment System</span>that you complete on-line with on-demand guidance and real-time analytics.</p>
          
<p>
         <span
            class="text-accent font-bold">Book your Getting Started session</span>today to conduct  your complementary RAM GPS assessment. Discover the power of this next generation approach to baselining, benchmarking and strategy development.

            
      </div>
      
      <div class="pt-3 mb-10 max-w-127.5 mx-auto">
        <blockquote class="relative">
          <p
            class={`text-lg italic font-medium  text-center" : " leading-relaxed"} md:leading-[1.85]`}
          >
            “ This assessment was so intuitive and brought our teams together. The analytics of our findings led us to taking the correct actions immediately”
          </p>
        </blockquote>

        <span class="block text-right mt-2 italic"
          >~ Plant Manager</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-4">
        <span class="block text-accent ">
          Discover this end-to-end system.
        </span>
      </h2>
      <!-- ../images/asset-criticality-02-640x319.jpg -->
      <BookDemo
        backgroundImage="../../assets/images/asset-criticality-02-640x319.jpg"
        buttonLabel="CLICK TO BOOK YOUR SESSION"
        href="/book-demo"
        minHeight="20rem"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div>
    <div
      class=" grid  grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-4 pt-8 sm:px-6 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10 lg:gap-14 lg:px-8"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <Heading level={4} class="mb-4 ">
            <span>Problems We Solve…</span>
          </Heading>
          <ul
            class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4"
          >
            <li>Assessments are incredibly costly and time consuming</li>
            <li>We evaluate things that aren’t even important to us</li>
            <li>They require facilitation we have to give up large chunks of time and take the assessment in totality</li>
            <li>Average travel expenses for our facilitator is around $2K</li>
            <li>The average cost of EAM assessments are $30,000</li>
                        <li>We don’t do much with the findings!</li>

          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="my-6">
          <Heading level={4} class="mb-4 ">
            <span>Solution Details…</span>
          </Heading>
          <p>
            Our <strong>Precisions Assessment System</strong> comes fully loaded with RAM-GPS, modeled around the 
            <strong> Uptime Elements Framework.</strong> 
             You can build or load your own customized assessments. Gain the power of a centralized assessment model that can be benchmarked, and that provides an asynchronous accurate model with no travel.
          </p>

          <ul
            class="list-disc space-y-1 pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700 mt-4"
          >
            <li>Ready-for-use Reliability & Asset Management precision assessment</li>
            <li>Customize your own assessment</li>
            <li>Asynchronous, on-demand SaaS application</li>
            <li>Full, real-time analytics</li>
            <li>Strategy building module for taking the right action, immediately</li>
               <li>Community benchmarking</li>
            <li>Internal corporate benchmarking</li>

          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl">
            <span class="block text-accent">
              Ready to solve these problems?
            </span>
          </h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 text-base leading-7 marker:text-sky-700">
            <li>Efforts are disconnected from the main goals of the organization</li>
            <li>Chasing the wrong (too many) initiatives and/or in the wrong order</li>
            <li>Not well coordinated across the organization – SILO’s of protective functions</li>
                        <li>Lack of communication & correct measures to unite and lock in habits</li>

                                    <li>Beyond “lip-service” – I feel like I’m fighting this battle alone</li>

          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-span-2">
        <Blockquote
          class="max-w-7xl mx-auto border-none shadow-none"
          variant="quote"
          textColor="text-accent"
        >
          Focus your limited resources on the most impactful actions immediately.
        </Blockquote>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <Heading level={4} class="mb-4 ">
            <span>What we offer…</span>
          </Heading>
          <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">




            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip"
              minHeight="14rem"
              frontTitle="Corporate CoE & Site-based Models"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Pre-configured for individual or multi-site corporate benchmarking"
            />
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip"
              minHeight="14rem"
              frontTitle="RAM-GPS Uptime Elements Assessment"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="A revolutionary, precision asessment system for your entire EAM program."
            />
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip"
              minHeight="14rem"
              frontTitle="Customized Assessments"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Load or build your own unlimited custom assessments in a single tool"
            />
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip"
              minHeight="14rem"
              frontTitle="Facilitated Working Sessions"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Remote or on-site Reliability & Asset Management expertise driving conversation and maximum discovery"
            />
             <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip"
              minHeight="14rem"
              frontTitle="Train-the-Facilitator Program"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Skills and process transfer for internalizatoin of a multi-site deployment approach"
            />
            <FlippingCard
              class="offer-flip"
              minHeight="14rem"
              frontTitle="Findings Evaluation and Strategy Design"
              frontBottomText="FLIP TO LEARN MORE"
              backText="Expert lead findings review, interpretation and actionable strategy design"
            />
          </div>

          <Heading level={5} class="my-4  text-right italic">
            <span
              >A balanced approach that is streamlined, scalable and fully automated</span
  >
          </Heading>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col  ">
          <Heading level={4} class="  mb-4">
            <span>We provide you with the insight and clarity…</span>
          </Heading>
          <p>
           …to know <strong>exactly</strong> where you are in your journey and what to work on based on your site’s individual objectives. Utilize our <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">on-demand analytics</span> to evaluate your performance, identify your gaps, and <strong>PowerRank℠</strong>  focused areas that will make the most significant impact on your business objectives.
          </p>
           <div class="my-6">
            
             <BookDemo
            backgroundImage="../../assets/images/bgn-quotes.jpg"
            buttonLabel="TAKE YOUR FIRST ASSESSMENT FREE"
            href="/book-demo"
            minHeight="13rem"
            demoHeading="If you want to experience the power and insight of our precision assessment system, sign up today for your own complimentary assessment and findings review session."
          >

        </BookDemo>

           </div>
         
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
 
  </Section>
</Layout>
